  "Qty 56 as published (Janus Greejatus counted once).",
  "Starting cards as posted: 'Stuff i have to start with' (the Objective, Epic Duel, Executor: Meditation Chamber, Executor: Holotheatre, Visage Of The Emperor) and 'Stuff i almost always with' (Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points, Crush The Rebellion). Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Janus' and 'Greejatus' on two consecutive lines dested one Janus Greejatus.",
  "Posted 'Dr. E 2' dested Dr. Evazan (qty 2 as published, unique card); plain 'Boba Fett' dested Boba Fett (Cloud City).",
  "Posted 'Executer Holotheater' dested Executor: Holotheatre; 'DS Docking Bay' Death Star: Docking Bay 327; 'CC Docking Bay' Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay); 'Bossk in Boat' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Fett in Slave' Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Twi'lek' Twi'lek Advisor; 'Ghhk' Ghhhk; 'Alter' the Dark Premiere Interrupt. Secret Plans and Resistance are the Effects (2001, no Defensive Shields)."
